  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "th_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -324
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Type halo\n\nThe phrase is tiled into 3 concentric RINGS. A ForEach lays each character around its ring: posInRing = i mod N, angle = posInRing·(2π/N) + spin (inner rings spin faster). Each letter’s size wiggles with sin(time + i), and hue cycles per character + time.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 260
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Type halo\n\nThe phrase is tiled into 3 concentric RINGS. A ForEach lays each character around its ring: posInRing = i mod N, angle = posInRing·(2π/N) + spin (inner rings spin faster). Each letter’s size wiggles with sin(time + i), and hue cycles per character + time.",
        "width": 500,
        "height": 260
      }
    },
